      },
      {
       "text": "Undefined",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "The sine graph reaches its maximum value of $1$ when $x=90^\\circ$, so $\\sin 90^\\circ=1$."
    },
    {
     "id": "b7d0d6ca-fd75-4aed-b381-76a3a3d12994",
     "prompt": "What is the period of the graph $y=\\cos x$?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "$90^\\circ$",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "$180^\\circ$",
